        606.0379028320312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "for training, and the stage cost was summed with a constraint",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        608.96630859375,
        563.0354614257812,
        617.8728637695312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "violation penalty, γc = 1500. The actor and critic, πϕ(zt),",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        619.1021118164062,
        563.037109375,
        630.9837036132812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qψ(zt, ut) were parameterized identically as fully connected",
