        653.3798828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "10% dropout, and ReLU activation functions.",
      "bbox": [
        311.97802734375,
        656.309326171875,
        498.25860595703125,
        665.2158813476562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The depth camera sensor measurement, yt, was limited to a",
      "bbox": [
        321.9400329589844,
        667.9548950195312,
        563.0390625,
        677.7158813476562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "resolution of 16×12 pixels. This low resolution enables rapid",
      "bbox": [
        311.97802734375,
        679.2330322265625,
        563.035400390625,
        688.8568725585938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "inference of the actor, critic, and sensor prediction models.",
      "bbox": [
