        691.7853393554688,
        563.0355224609375,
        700.69189453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Additionally, given the simplicity of these inputs compared to",
      "bbox": [
        311.97802734375,
        703.621337890625,
        563.0354614257812,
        712.5278930664062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "a high-resolution image, the learned models converge faster",
      "bbox": [
        311.97802734375,
        715.4573364257812,
