        724.3638916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and generalize better. While this resolution may limit the",
      "bbox": [
        311.97802734375,
        727.2923583984375,
        563.0354614257812,
        736.1989135742188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
